    "q_en": "The ratio of two numbers is 5 : 7 and their sum is 96. What are these numbers?",
    "q_hi": "दो संख्याओं का अनुपात 5 : 7 है और उनका योग 96 है। ये संख्याएँ क्या हैं?",
    "section": "Arithmetic1",
    "solution": "1. Let the two numbers be 5x and 7x.\n2. According to the question, their sum is 96.\n3. 5x + 7x = 96 ⇒ 12x = 96 ⇒ x = 8.\n4. First number = 5 × 8 = 40.\n5. Second number = 7 × 8 = 56.<br><br>1. मान लीजिए दो संख्याएँ 5x और 7x हैं।\n2. प्रश्न के अनुसार, उनका योग 96 है।\n3. 5x + 7x = 96 ⇒ 12x = 96 ⇒ x = 8.\n4. पहली संख्या = 5 × 8 = 40.\n5. दूसरी संख्या = 7 × 8 = 56.<br><br><b>Short Trick:</b> Sum of ratios (5+7) = 12 units. 12 units = 96 ⇒ 1 unit = 8. Numbers are 5×8=40 and 7×8=56.",
    "topic": "Ratio and Proportion"
  },
