    "q_en": "A man buys 10 identical articles for a total of ₹20. If he sells each of them for ₹2.1, then his profit percentage will be ______%.<span style=\"color: white;\">10794</span>",
    "q_hi": "एक आदमी ₹20 में कुल 10 समान वस्तुएँ खरीदता है। यदि वह उनमें से प्रत्येक को ₹2.1 में बेचता है, तो उसका लाभ प्रतिशत ______% होगा।",
    "section": "Arithmetic1",
    "solution": "1. Total CP of 10 articles = ₹20. CP of 1 article = 20 / 10 = ₹2.\n2. SP of 1 article = ₹2.1.\n3. Profit per article = SP - CP = 2.1 - 2 = ₹0.1.\n4. Profit % = (Profit / CP) × 100 = (0.1 / 2) × 100 = 5%.<br><br>1. 10 वस्तुओं का कुल क्रय मूल्य (CP) = ₹20. 1 वस्तु का CP = ₹2.\n2. 1 वस्तु का विक्रय मूल्य (SP) = ₹2.1.\n3. लाभ = SP - CP = 2.1 - 2 = ₹0.1.\n4. लाभ % = (लाभ / CP) × 100 = (0.1 / 2) × 100 = 5%.<br><br><b>Short Trick:</b> CP = 2, SP = 2.1. Profit % = (0.1/2) × 100 = 5%.",
